From: Gigachad Enthusiast <32457258-AreteMaxxing@users.noreply.gitlab.com>
Date: Sun, 25 Oct 2026 14:27:18 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Graphics paging: read the camera through CvScreensInterface,
 drop the mod's CvGameInterface.py

The mod's EntryPoints/CvGameInterface.py, added in !57 for the camera,
was not the Beyond the Sword file: it lacked 22 callbacks the original
DLL calls and returned plain CvGameUtils instead of BUG's dispatcher,
so RoM's rules in RoMGameUtils (unit and building costs, upgrade
prices, pillage and capture gold, cannotConstruct, cannotDoCivic) were
not reached. getCameraView moves unchanged to the mod's
CvScreensInterface.py, the DLL asks PYScreensModule for it, and the
mod's CvGameInterface.py is deleted so the game's own file answers.

Serves: P15
