 .../Python/EntryPoints/CvScreensInterface.py  |  31 +++
 Docs/GRAPHICS_PAGING.md                       |  40 ++-
 4 files changed, 70 insertions(+), 258 deletions(-)
 delete mode 100644 Assets/Python/EntryPoints/CvGameInterface.py

